{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_title", "source_sha256": "ff361ff03c55028b82d6f5d8d77402540f6ceedbd008aeffa5ac20a36de203ce", "ja": "ミリシタ感謝祭 2021～2022 留守電1", "zh": "MLTD感谢祭 2021～2022 留言电话1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d47006d64ca5b36c18d68c7f9a95fbcfa096dc4a5f19b5f2c88f5e47968dcfa5", "ja": "感謝祭公演を翌日に控えた\n紗代子からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是在感恩祭公演前一天，高山纱代子留下的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "11b44ab42878ac88409288c4464fc924253a51cb639ced78deb9022d30ffd600", "ja": "あっ。る、留守電になっちゃった。", "zh": "啊，变、变成留言了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "983e2f774bf1c393ebb83f63a564c8ab8d47ed35e17df5dc5d040e9860cba4aa", "ja": "あの、えっと。{$P$}、\nお疲れさまです！　紗代子です。", "zh": "那个，呃……{$P$}先生，\n辛苦了！我是纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "4b2a64561d4cc88f6873bf6bc1030427a1d30bd6224a0c7082e3acb25e5f5879", "ja": "すみません。別に、大した用事じゃなかったんです。\nちょっと、話がしたかっただけで。", "zh": "对不起。其实也没什么重要的事。\n只是想和您聊几句。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "d064b1c93a2104bddf51771d7ba156311897c06f31962f94762d0d70008d7b62", "ja": "……いよいよ感謝祭ライブですね。緊張しているのは\nもちろん、みんな同じだと思うんですけど。", "zh": "……终于要到感谢祭演出呢。虽然我想\n大家肯定都一样很紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "7722de099ef309606271c8eebbe890e50ddae0f9a428e7d714d10bdcd4d860d3", "ja": "なんだか、張り詰めてる……っていうか。\nピリピリしてるけど、それがイヤな感じじゃなくて……", "zh": "总觉得，气氛绷得很紧……该怎么说呢。\n虽然有些剑拔弩张，但并不会让人觉得讨厌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "7fcc1ae197fe8ff3783024fc1abf7427764d6ce360de622d9ba9ec5009287cf7", "ja": "あっ、そう！　ちょうど、今の空気みたいな……\nあ、すみません。私、今、外にいるんです。", "zh": "啊，对！正好，就像现在的气氛一样……\n啊，不好意思。我现在人在外面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "c412bc22bfb764d68680cf6194c35ded6869dd298885095e7bf679988ea70264", "ja": "寒いけど、星がとっても綺麗ですよ。近くに大きな公園\nがあるせいかな……。オリオン座が綺麗に見えます。", "zh": "虽然很冷，但星星特别漂亮哦。可能是因为附近有个大公园\n吧……能很清楚地看到猎户座呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "afbbcfb13e7511e2ee2888970258f68d3029c4937cb314069dde1fdc2aec2df9", "ja": "なんだか懐かしい感じ……。あ、今回の会場って、\n私の地元にちょっと近いせいかもですね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "总觉得有种怀念的感觉……啊，或许是因为这次的会场离我的家乡比较近吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "25f47baaf0d2dbac20a92afb20b2a309bdfeffef45d3cfb25dd5796351f5776a", "ja": "{$P$}も、今ごろどこかで\n星を見ていますか？", "zh": "{$P$}现在也在某个地方\n看着星空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "6a5ed310a1349a07a0643116600e87fbc4c779ff176af907bec95cecaa1a00f7", "ja": "なんて、関係ない話ばっかりしちゃってますね。\nやっぱり、緊張してるだけだったのかな。", "zh": "不知不觉净说些无关紧要的话呢。\n果然，我只是太紧张了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "3800ae193f2d8603256a2e7d06b9a04a3dc07e615eb1d970b7819c283eeac4aa", "ja": "でも、{$P$}に話したら、\nすこし楽になりました。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "不过，跟{$P$}聊了聊之后，感觉轻松了一些。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "376266fefc6babcf6e1702f26f0ba0088c87bab00a5e8540659b3b31038a6962", "ja": "……明日、晴れるといいですね。", "zh": "……希望明天会放晴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_504_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_504_st_01_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "d31361b38afb522bee901419837eb3ab94dd82a5210f124b9116c0b99a9255a5", "ja": "それじゃ、お疲れさまでした。また明日！", "zh": "那么，辛苦了。明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
